-- title:
--   The exact seventh-row odd error function
-- statement:
--   Define the fixed eighteen-entry rational error vector $e$, the odd polynomial $E^{\rm poly}_7(w)=-K_7\sum_{i<18} e_iw^{2i+3}$ with $K_7=3\sqrt{15145}/2720$, and the total odd error $E^{\rm odd}_7=E^{\rm poly}_7+T^{\rm tail}_7$.
